/* ================================================================ inbox
   The inbox and schedules, with the schedule dialog. */

/* ================================================================ inbox & schedules
   What each scheduled run produced, newest first, under day headings that stay put as you scroll;
   the schedules themselves in a rail on the right, each with a thin bar filling toward its next run. */
.inbox {
